/*
 * Southern defense tower basement
 * western corner — west of stower3 /
 * south of stower2.
 *
 * Strategy A FluffOS room. Original
 * (SearchCmd, CheckWheelDesc /
 * CheckOpening nightday, east stower3,
 * north stower2) is stower4_ldmud.lpc.
 * Look-ats only: search / climb / chain
 * machinery / raise/lower are not
 * loaded. Frozen: QueryChain=0 (wheel
 * empty, iron chain attached);
 * CheckOpening as day (light through
 * the opening; this room has breaks).
 * Later AddDetail("stairway") overwrites
 * the VItem stairway id only. Later
 * AddVItem level overwrites IntLong
 * level. Archive keeps “an small
 * opening”, “stairways leading up”,
 * “Thereis also”, “yellow light It is
 * made”, “much details”. East stower3
 * and north stower2 are loaded.
 */

